    <h3
      class="flex items-center mb-1 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
    >
      <span
        class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-xs font-semibold mr-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded dark:bg-blue-200 dark:text-blue-800"
      >
        2021
      </span>
      <span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">Scholarship</span>
    </h3>
    <time
      datetime="2021-09"
      class="block mb-2 text-sm font-normal leading-none text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300"
    >
      September 2021
    </time>
    <p class="text-base font-normal text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200">
      I entered a government program that placed me in a company where I
      optimized and redesigned web pages with CSS and Bootstrap.
    </p>
  </li>

